      en: ["'QuickCash — {$amount} in 10 minutes, no questions!' The shop is wedged between a betting office and a vape store. The interest rate is written in ancient Gaelic.", "A text: 'Need {$amount}? Instant cash! Interest rate: yes.' The logo is a smiling pig in a top hat."],
