      en: ["Your little payday loan has grown into {$amount}. You took a second loan to repay the first, then a third for the second. The pig in the top hat calls you by your first name.", "The interest had babies. You owe {$amount}. A debt collector named Tony, with a neck wider than your head, rings your doorbell."],
