      en: ["Your manager suggests a 'giveaway': an iPhone for everyone who follows, likes, shares and hands over their phone number. There is no iPhone. There never was an iPhone.", "Followers found out the winner of your 'luxury car' giveaway is your cousin. And the car is a repainted hatchback. They have proof. And pitchforks."],
