      en: ["You launched your merch line: hoodies with your face and your catchphrase. You ordered 10,000 units for {$amount}. After a week, you've sold 37. Twelve to your grandmother.", "Your garage is stacked to the ceiling with boxes of hoodies bearing your face. Your followers say the fabric 'feels like a kitchen sponge'."],
