      en: ["Your bank statement shows {$amount} in purchases you didn't make: 300 kilos of cat litter in Kazakhstan, a yodelling club membership and a bus ticket to Wolverhampton.", "Alert from your bank: someone used your card for a dinner for six at a Michelin-starred restaurant in Dubai. You're in sweatpants in your kitchen eating cereal."],
