      en: ["You're on 'Wheel of Luck'. One letter left to win a car. The phrase: '_ _ _ _ _ _ ON THE CAKE'. The audience holds its breath.", "Sunday game show. The host, with glow-in-the-dark teeth, offers you: the car behind the curtain, or the mystery envelope. Your aunt screams advice from the stands."],
