      en: ["Planting tomatoes, your shovel hits something metal. A rusty chest. Inside: gold coins, jewellery and a letter from 1942 that begins 'If you're reading this, you bastard…'.", "Your dog has been digging frantically in the garden for three days. Today he brings you a gold coin. Then another. He awaits his reward."],
